# dispatch_task — Dispatch Task

(Lead only) Create a subtask under a submitted parent task and assign it to a worker. Always provide parent_task_id so the parent task tracks completion. Always state route_reason: why THIS agent (specialty fit / shortest queue / past success evidence from the member capability table) — it is kept on the task as an auditable routing decision.

## Schema
```ts
type Args = {
  /** ID of the worker agent to assign this task to */
  assignee_id: string;
  /** Short task title */
  title: string;
  /** Why this agent was chosen (specialty fit / load / past success evidence) — one short line, kept as the auditable routing decision */
  route_reason?: string;
  /** Detailed task description with requirements */
  description?: string;
  /** The ID of the submitted parent task this subtask belongs to (from the task list) */
  parent_task_id: string;
};
```
Execute by writing JSON to xd://dispatch_task.

